    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobooni waan qabu ch'ufa fud'ate Beersheba d'aqe achiti sorio Waaqa abba isaa Isaaqoti baase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi halkani daayya keesa dubbateeni, Yakobo, Yakobo! jed'e yaame. Yaa, anini kuno, Aabbo jed'e owaate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini Waaqa, Waaqa abba keetiti; lafa Misiri d'aqu insodaatini; achiti gosa guddo si tolcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gara lafa Misiri si geese hegerile gadi si deebisa gaafa atini doote Yusufuti si awaala jed'eeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yakobooni Beershebaa kae, ilmaani isaa, isaafi ijoolle worraa didiqo, ammalle nad'eeni worrale ch'ufa gaari Faraoni erge yaabachiifte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 7.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani worri horifi waan lafa Kanaani keesati horate ch'ufa fud'ate lafa Misiriti godaane. Yakobooni nama isaa ch'ufa ufi gula fud'ate: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilmaani isaatiifi akhakhowani isaati, dubra isaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami worra Yakobo ka isa woliini lafa Misiriti godaane kana: angafa isaa Reubenifi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilmaani Reubeni: Hanoki, Palu, Hesroni, Karmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simeonifi ilmaani isaa: Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohari ammalle Shauli, ilma niiti gosa Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawifi ilmaani isaa: Gershoni, Kohathi, ammalle Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yudafi ilmaani isaa: Shela, Peresi, ammalle Zera. (Ilmaani Yuda ta d'ibiini, Erifi Onani lafa Kanaaniti doote.) Ilmaani Peresi Hesronifi Hamuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isakarifi ilmaani isaa: Tola, Pua, Yashubu, Shimroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zabulonifi ilmaani isaa: Seredi, Eloni, Yaleeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunini ilmaani Leani Yakoboo d'alte lafa Mesopotamia keesati, intala isii Dina wolti. Ilmaani mana Lea ch'ufti wolti nama sodomi sadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadifi ilmaani isaa: Sefoni, Hagi, Shuni, Esboni, Eri, Arodi ammalle Areli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asherifi ilmaani isaa: Imna, Ishva, Ishvi, Beria, ammalle oboleeti worraa Sera. Ilmaani Beria Heberifi Malkieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud'ani jaani tunini ilmaani Zilpaani, intalti Labaniini Leaa kenne, Yakobo d'alte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niitiini Yakobo ta Raheli jed'ani ilmaani lama d'alteefi: Yusufufi Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.41.50+GEN.41.51+GEN.41.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 41.50-52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa Misiri keesati Yusufuuni ilmaani lama d'ale, Manaseefi Efraimu; ijoolle tana Asenathi, ta dubra Potifera, ka qaallu lafa Oniti, isaa d'ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani Benjamini tana: Bela, Bekeri, Ashbeli, Gera, Naamani, Ehi, Roshi, Mupimu, Hupimu ammalle Ardi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud'ani afraani tunini ilmaani Raheliini Yakobo d'alte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Danifi ilma isaa Hushimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naftalifi ilmaani isaa: Yaseeli, Guni, Yaseri, Shilemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torbaani tunini ilmaani Bilhaani, intalti Labaniini Rahelii Kenne, Yakobo d'alte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani Yakobo, ta lafa Misiriti godaante, nad'eeni worraa male, isiini ch'allaani jaatami jaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 7.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa Misiri keesa Yusufuuni ijoolle lama d'ale, tanaafi worri Yakobo ch'ufti wolti torbatama, ka lafa Misiriti godaane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
