              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yusufuuni waan oboleyaani isaatiifi worra abba isaa ch'ufaani jed'e, Anini d'aqe waan Faraoni jed'u, Oboleyaani tiyyafi worri abba kiyya ch'ufti, ka duri lafa Kanaani keesa tau, ya nati d'ufe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri kunini tissitu; looni, ree ammalle hori waan qabu ch'ufaani ya d'ufate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja Faraoni isani yaame, Hujiini teesani maani? jed'e isani gaafate, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waan jettaniini, Nufi worri keennaleeni haguma d'alanne tissitu horiti. Akanaani inni lafa Gosheni isani teesisa. Wonti Yusufuuni akasi jed'eefi, tissituuni horii aada worra Misiri keesa falfala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.34"
            ]
